    "passive": {
      "name": "Traveler's Call",
      "description": "Bard attracts <span style=\"color: #cccc00\">Chimes</span> randomly around the map. When Bard moves near a <span style=\"color: #cccc00\">Chime</span> he collects it, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">24% Move Speed</span> (stacking up to 10 times) while out of combat for 20 seconds, Experience, and restoring <span>12% max Mana</span>.<br /><br />Bard attracts a <span style=\"color: #FF9900\">Meep</span> every seconds (max: ). Bard's Attacks consume a <span style=\"color: #FF9900\">Meep</span> to deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30 + (40% Ability Power)) plus 6 per 5 <span style=\"color: #cccc00\">Chimes</span> magic damage</span>, plus additional effects based on <span style=\"color: #cccc00\">Chimes</span> collected.",
